+
+- Residual list printed first and sorted by hand. 93 lines (the plan measured 100 before 08-04 finished): 37 display name in prose, comments, titles and the two User-Agent strings; 20 example and test origins; 14 dev passwords (seed, reset, test database default and the docs that quote them); 18 test scaffolding (temp prefixes, git identities, the knip banner, the scrub fixture, the `/nonexistent/...` path); 3 clock symbols; 1 worktree path convention. No line fit none of them, so nothing was held back.
