+- Read the whole added diff before committing. Writers and readers moved together: `buildUserAgent` and its assertion in `request-queue.test.ts`; `SEED_PASSWORD` in `supabase/seed/seed-users.ts` and `e2e/support/env.ts`, plus the onboarding tests and two docs; the test database default in `service-stack.ts` with `docs/development.md` and `docs/testing.md`.
